  "reasoning": "The defendants organized an online capital operation, set up reporting points, and attracted the public to invest money with promised high returns, without any legal qualification to accept public deposits. This constitutes the crime of illegally raising public funds (非法吸收公众存款) under the Criminal Law. No other distinct crimes are indicated in the facts.",
